[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Every root, tab, screen, row and node is addressable by a route derived from its UID

[GRAMMAR]
IMPORT_FROM_FILE: @repo

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-EVERY-PART-HAS-A-ROUTE
TITLE: Every root, tab, screen, row and node is addressable by a route derived from its UID
DEPTH: interface-settled
AUTHORED_BY: llm
STATEMENT: >>>
Every root, tab, screen, row and node on the page has a route a link can carry: the whole UID lowercased for a narrative or node, with a row number or a preselected legend word appended where one applies. A route is never derived by stripping a prefix, because a tree may contain narratives from another directory whose UIDs share nothing with the root's.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: DEC-NARRATIVE-DECLARES-ITS-PLACE
  ROLE: Governed_By
